      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        276.84010000000001,
        428.79599999999982,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "criteria are examined less frequently (once every 18 months). Banks that are in troubled condition"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        260.84010000000001,
        429.4459999999998,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "are examined more frequently. The Federal Reserve coordinates its examinations of state member"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        244.84010000000001,
        427.49399999999991,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "banks with those of the chartering state’s bank supervisor and it may alternate examinations with"
