      "text" : "the bank’s state supervisor."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        196.84010000000001,
        226.14599999999996,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "The objectives of an examination are, essentially, to"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        176.84010000000001,
        253.54599999999994,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "1. provide an objective evaluation of a bank’s soundness;"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        156.84010000000001,
        346.44599999999991,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "2. determine the level of risk involved in the bank’s transactions and activities;"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        136.84010000000001,
        367.64499999999987,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "3. ascertain the extent of the bank’s compliance with banking laws and regulations;"
